    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="158" width="60" height="44">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="Montserrat" color="rgba(34,211,238,1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>01</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="120" topLeftY="156" width="784" height="86">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(148,163,184,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span fontSize="17" bold="true" color="rgba(241,245,249,1)">Static models miss emergence.</span></p>
        <p>Fixed dashboards and single-point forecasts cannot show how crowds, rumors, and reactions compound into outcomes nobody predicted.</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="120" startY="252" endX="904" endY="252">
      <border color="rgba(148,163,184,0.12)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="270" width="60" height="44">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="Montserrat" color="rgba(34,211,238,1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>02</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="120" topLeftY="268" width="784" height="86">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(148,163,184,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span fontSize="17" bold="true" color="rgba(241,245,249,1)">Real-world trials are slow and irreversible.</span></p>
        <p>Testing a policy, deployment, or message in the real world takes weeks and costs money — and cannot be undone once people are harmed.</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="120" startY="364" endX="904" endY="364">
      <border color="rgba(148,163,184,0.12)" width="1"/>
    </line>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="382" width="60" height="44">
      <content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="Montserrat" color="rgba(34,211,238,1)" bold="true" wrap="false">
        <p>03</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="120" topLeftY="380" width="784" height="86">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(148,163,184,1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.55">
        <p><span fontSize="17" bold="true" color="rgba(241,245,249,1)">Rumors move faster than analysis.</span></p>
        <p>Sentiment and disinformation spread in hours; by the time a report is written, the crowd has already made up its mind.</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

